息","options":["休息","咳嗽","发烧","诊所"],"translation":"休息","grammarTags":["have-got"],"skillTags":["vocabulary"]},{"id":"a1-u49-l1-q8","kind":"choice","prompt":"The nurse says I have got a mild cold.","instruction":"选择意思。","answer":"护士说我只是轻微感冒。","options":["护士说我只是轻微感冒。","护士说我需要立刻住院。","护士说我的预约被取消了。","护士说药片应该饭前吃。"],"audio":"The nurse says I have got a mild cold.","translation":"护士说我只是轻微感冒。","grammarTags":["have-got"],"skillTags":["reading"]},{"id":"a1-u49-l1-q9","kind":"listen","prompt":"听句子，选择意思。","instruction":"听完整句子。","answer":"请今天多休息。","options":["请今天多休息。","请明天早点出门。","请在柜台付款。","请把预约写下来。"],"audio":"Please get plenty of rest today.","translation":"请今天多休息。","grammarTags":["have-got"],"skillTags":["listening"]},{"id":"a1-u49-l1-q10","kind":"fill","prompt":"I have got an _____ at three o'clock.","instruction":"选择名词。","answer":"appointment","options":["appointment","tablet","fever","cough"],"audio":"I have got an appointment at three o'clock.","translation":"我三点有预约。","grammarTags":["have-got"],"skillTags":["grammar"]}],"dialogue":{"id":"a1-u49-l1-dialogue","scene":"诊所问诊","characters":[{"id":"lumi","name":"Lumi"},{"id":"nurse","name":"Nurse"}],"turns":[{"speaker":"lumi","text":"I have got a cough today.","translation":"我今天咳嗽。"},{"speaker":"nurse","text":"Please sit down and rest for a moment.","translation":"请坐下休息一会儿。"},{"speaker":"lumi","text":"Thank you. I have an appointment at three.","translation":"谢谢。我三点有预约。"}]},"sourceStatus":"hand-authored"}
